scr("3",2,"In North American fare note displays, the paragraphs do not have numbers.")
scr("3",2,"Rather, each category has a 2-letter code. In this example, MN^ refers to")
scr("3",2,"the minimum stay.")
scr("3",2,"<PgDn>")
scr("3",5,"PD")
scr("4",2,"Each category has a keyword as well as a 2-letter code. For example, the")
scr("4",2,"keyword ADVANCE^ or the code AP^ may be used to display the advance purchase")
scr("4",2,"restriction. The keyword MINIMUM^ or the code MN^ may be used to display the")
scr("4",2,"minimum stay, and the keyword MAXIMUM^ or the code MX^ may be used to display")
scr("4",2,"the maximum stay. Input the entry to display the maximum stay for the fare")
scr("4",2,"basis in line 3.")
scr("4",5,"FQN3*MX")
scr("4",5,"FQN3*MAXIMUM")
scr("4",5,"FQN3*8")
scr("4",5,"FQN3//MAXIMUM")
scr("4",5,"FQN3//8")
